        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/CosmosMind-ai/ChemArgus",
          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gap_in_prior_benchmarks": {
      "value": "论文认为现有前沿化学基准仍主要给最终答案打分，从而把记忆与逐步推导混在一起，把视觉输入与文本输入视为可互换，并把长程规划与逐步执行混为一谈，无法说明推理链在何处断开",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20012",
          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://www.cosmosmind.ai/leaderboard/chemargus",
          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/CosmosMind-ai/ChemArgus",
          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
